{"id":"maps","duration":52.29,"voice":"Juniper","segments":[{"t":0,"cap":"A map is only as good as the number in each region."},{"t":3.68,"cap":"A choropleth fills each region with a color. Use it for rates or shares, such as cases per ten thousand residents."},{"t":13.35,"cap":"Fill it with raw counts, and the map mostly shows where people live."},{"t":17.77,"cap":"In Ohio, Franklin, Cuyahoga and Hamilton counties hold about a third of the people, so they lead almost any count."},{"t":26.68,"cap":"For totals, use proportional symbols: one circle per region, sized by the count."},{"t":33.39,"cap":"A cartogram resizes the regions themselves by a variable such as population, so small, crowded places are not hidden by large, empty ones."},{"t":45.35,"cap":"So before you read any map of counts, ask how many people live in each region."}],"items":[{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":0.25,"x":44,"y":30,"h":54,"text":"What does each region show?","d":0.95,"big":true,"color":"red"},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":3.68,"x":44,"y":84,"h":44,"text":"choropleth: each region","d":0.81},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":5.1,"x":78,"y":128,"h":44,"text":"filled with a color","d":0.67},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":7.85,"x":44,"y":172,"h":44,"text":"for rates or shares","d":0.67},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":10.83,"x":78,"y":216,"h":44,"text":"(per 10,000 residents)","d":0.77},{"k":"sketch","page":0,"t":3.68,"name":"countVsRate","box":{"x":500,"y":96,"w":430,"h":414},"phases":[13.35,18.71]},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":13.35,"x":44,"y":260,"h":44,"text":"raw counts mostly show","d":0.77,"color":"blue"},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":15.94,"x":78,"y":304,"h":44,"text":"where people live","d":0.6,"color":"blue"},{"k":"hand","page":0,"t":18.71,"x":44,"y":348,"h":44,"text":"3 counties: 1/3 of Ohioans","d":0.91},{"k":"page","page":1,"t":26.68},{"k":"hand","page":1,"t":26.93,"x":44,"y":30,"h":54,"text":"Totals: proportional symbols","d":0.98,"big":true,"color":"red"},{"k":"hand","page":1,"t":29.72,"x":44,"y":84,"h":44,"text":"one ci